          <div class="article-subscribe"><div><button type="button" id="follow-button-0.14660206972147438" data-auth-action="signin" data-follower-count="0" data-selected="false" aria-describedby="subscriptons-description-0.8792788744748556" aria-label="Follow Article" aria-pressed="false">Follow</button><span class="IJDXXdfgVXcY6MRd9u66HghwrbdhBtJv" id="subscriptons-description-0.8792788744748556">Not yet followed by anyone</span></div></div>
        
      </header>

      <section class="article-info">
        <div class="article-content">
          <div class="article-body"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Some of Fandom's features can be enabled and disabled by local admins using <strong><a href="https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Admin_Dashboard" target="_self" rel="undefined">Admin Dashboard</a></strong> on that wiki, such as:</span></p>
<ul>
<li>Requiring all contributors to log in
</li>
<li>
<strong><a href="https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Message_Wall" target="_self">Message Wall</a></strong>
</li>
<li>
<a href="https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Comments" target="_self" rel="undefined"><strong>Article Comments</strong></a>
</li>
<li><strong><a href="https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Blogs" target="_self">Blogs</a></strong></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you are an admin, click on "Admin" on your bottom toolbar to find this page.<br></span></p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">To request an interlanguage link please see <strong><a href="/hc/en-us/articles/360035267334-I-want-to-set-up-an-interlanguage-link" target="_self" rel="undefined">this help desk article</a></strong>.</span></p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">For other features and extensions, such as the following, you may need assistance:</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br></span></p>
<ul>
<li>
<span style="font-weight: 400;">Turning on&#160;</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong><a href="https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Community_CSS_and_JS#JavaScript" target="_self">custom JavaScript</a></strong> editing</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">&#160;</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">on for your wiki.</span>
<ul>
<li><em><span style="font-weight: 400;">Note: <strong><a href="https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Including_additional_CSS_and_JS#ImportJS">ImportJS</a></strong> does not require this to be enabled.</span></em></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<span style="font-weight: 400;">Enabling </span><strong><a href="https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Achievements" target="_self">achievements (aka badges)</a></strong>.</li>
<li>Other extensions <strong><a href="https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Extensions#Available_on_request" target="_self">listed here</a></strong>, such as DPL or Variables.</li>
</ul>
<p>If your wiki has Fandom team contact assigned,&#160;please ask them for assistance. Otherwise, <strong><a href="/hc/en-us/requests/new?ticket_form_id=360000931354&tf_360017817454=i_want_a_feature_or_extension_turned_on" target="_self" rel="undefined">click here</a></strong> to contact us for these extensions.</p></div>

          

          
        </div>
      </section>

